units metal
atom_style atomic
dimension 3
boundary p p s
newton on
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region box block 0 66 0 66 0 213 units box
create_box 1 box
mass 1 92.906
region proj block 0 66 0 66 0 66 units box
region targ block 0 66 0 66 81 213 units box
create_atoms 1 region proj
create_atoms 1 region targ
group projectile region proj
group target region targ
group all union projectile target
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix nvt_all all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix nvt_all
reset_timestep 0
velocity projectile add 0 0 20
fix nve_all all nve
run 200000
